      <title>44 pounds of fentanyl seized in Madison County; two charged</title>
      <link>https://sciotovalleyguardian.com/2026/02/26/44-pounds-of-fentanyl-seized-in-madison-county-two-charged/</link>
      <description>MADISON COUNTY, Ohio — Authorities seized 44 pounds of fentanyl in Madison County this week in what state officials described as one of the largest fentanyl busts ever for a Central Ohio drug task force. Ohio Attorney General Dave Yost announced the seizure Thursday, saying the drugs were confiscated Wednesday as part of an ongoing […]</description>
